# GameSnake

A custom Python frontend for Libretro cores.

Started on a Friday because college was boring.

## Current Features

✅ Loads mGBA

✅ Loads GBA ROMs

✅ Video output

✅ Keyboard input

✅ Audio that mostly behaves itself

## Known Issues

❌ Audio occasionally turns into breakfast cereal

❌ No save support

❌ No controller support

❌ Probably several things I haven't found yet

## Tested Games

- Pokémon FireRed

## Roadmap

- Better audio
- Save files
- Save states
- Controllers
- Fast-forward
- More cores

## Development Status

"It's alive."
